  "blurb": [
    "The imperial army has come down on Guangzong, the last great Yellow Turban stronghold. The Zhang brothers hold it: Zhang Jiao, the self-styled Lord of Heaven, lies sick behind the palisade, and his brothers Zhang Liang and Zhang Bao keep the camp and the rebel altar. Liu Bei marches in the vanguard with two companies of imperial regulars beside him.",
    "Between the armies lies a river and a belt of ripe millet on either bank, and fire has been very kind to the Han so far. But Zhang Bao is a sorcerer with a reputation for dragging the sky about by the collar. Whoever burns the millet needs to remember who owns the wind."
  ],
